# Circle Agent Stack
# Authentication is handled by the Circle CLI itself. There is no Circle API
# key. The demo handles login (email + OTP) and stops for you to accept the
# Terms of Use if your account has not.
#
# Payments settle on Base, or Polygon when a service offers no Base option.
# The chain is chosen per service; there is nothing to configure.
# https://developers.circle.com/agent-stack

# LLM provider — set ONE of the two keys below. ANTHROPIC_API_KEY is checked
# first; if absent, OPENAI_API_KEY is used. The default models are:
#   Anthropic: anthropic/claude-sonnet-4-6
#   OpenAI:    openai/gpt-5.4
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
OPENAI_API_KEY=

# Optional: override the model (include the provider prefix for Mastra,
# e.g. "anthropic/claude-opus-4-7" or "openai/gpt-4o-mini")
# LLM_MODEL=

# Optional: chain named in the startup log line (default: BASE). The chain a
# payment settles on is chosen per service, not from this.
# CIRCLE_CHAIN=BASE
